---
import ServiceLogistics from "./ServiceLogistics.astro";
import { sharpeningServices } from "../config/sharpeningServices";
---
<!-- ====================================================
PANEL: SERVICES
==================================================== -->
<div id="panel-services" class="panel" aria-hidden="false">
<div class="panel-inner">
<p class="sub-eyebrow">Built for working kitchens and serious tools.</p>
<h1 class="sub-headline-cyan text-4xl lg:text-5xl mb-3">Services</h1>
<p class="sub-body mb-10 max-w-2xl text-sm">Every edge is approached through geometry, steel preservation, and real-world kitchen performance. Working prep knives can stay lean and practical. Premium knives, sentimental tools, and showpiece blades can receive more refinement, correction, and finish care.</p>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
<div class="service-tile">
<div class="service-tile-title">Knife Sharpening</div>
<div class="service-tile-body">Standard fine-edge sharpening is priced by blade length: $9 minimum for knives 6 inches or smaller, then $1.50 per inch. Serrated knives start at $12 and are $2 per inch.</div>
<div class="price-tag">From $9</div>
</div>
<div class="service-tile">
<div class="service-tile-title">Repair &amp; Restoration</div>
<div class="service-tile-body">Chip repair, tip repair, thinning, reprofiling, rust cleanup, and corrective work for knives that need more than a quick pass on a belt.</div>
<div class="price-tag">Repairs from $6</div>
<p class="service-tile-body mt-3">Minor repairs are $6, major repairs are $10, and heavy or specialty repairs start at $20+. Thinning starts at $16 per side and scales with material removed, labor, abrasives, and time.</p>
</div>
<div class="service-tile">
<div class="service-tile-title">Restaurant &amp; Hotel Programs</div>
<div class="service-tile-body">Scheduled edge-care programs for kitchens that need consistency, accountability, and tools ready for service. One-time resets and recurring accounts are priced by volume, timing, and scope.</div>
<div class="price-tag">From $150 reset</div>
</div>
<div class="service-tile">
<div class="service-tile-title">White Glove Knife Care</div>
<div class="service-tile-body">A premium care path for knives that deserve more than a working edge: pickup-ready packaging, handle care, aesthetic refresh, careful edge refinement, polishing, and protective coating where appropriate.</div>
<div class="price-tag">From $30/knife</div>
</div>
</div>

<ServiceLogistics mode="overview" />

<section class="specialty-services mb-12" aria-labelledby="specialty-services-heading">
<p class="sub-eyebrow">More than kitchen knives</p>
<h2 id="specialty-services-heading" class="text-2xl text-white mb-4">The right edge for the tool.</h2>
<p class="sub-body mb-5">Shears, workshop tools, specialty blades, and custom work each need their own approach. Choose a service to start a request with that option already selected. Sean reviews the tool, condition, intended use, and whether the right path is a working edge, premium finish, repair, or restoration.</p>
<ul class="specialty-service-list">
{sharpeningServices.map(service => <li><a href={`/send-photos/?service=${service.value}`}>{service.label}<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></li>)}
</ul>
</section>

<section class="mb-12 pt-2" aria-labelledby="service-paths-heading">
<p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400/70 font-bold mb-2">Explore Service Pages</p>
<h3 id="service-paths-heading" class="text-white/82 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide mb-5">Choose the right edge-care path</h3>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
<a href="/knife-sharpening-miami/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Knife Sharpening in Miami</div><div class="service-tile-body">Professional edge care for Japanese, Western, serrated, and everyday kitchen knives.</div></a>
<a href="/restaurant-knife-sharpening-miami/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Restaurant Knife Sharpening</div><div class="service-tile-body">Recurring fleet sharpening and repair for restaurants, hotels, and commercial kitchens.</div></a>
<a href="/sharp-after-dark/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Sharp After Dark</div><div class="service-tile-body">After-hours collection and return designed around service and prep schedules.</div></a>
<a href="/japanese-knife-sharpening-miami/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Premium Knife Sharpening</div><div class="service-tile-body">Careful sharpening for premium steels, single-bevel knives, Japanese and Western makers, and geometry-sensitive blades.</div></a>
<a href="/knife-repair-restoration-miami/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Knife Repair &amp; Restoration</div><div class="service-tile-body">Assessment and correction for chips, broken tips, rust, wear, and damaged profiles.</div></a>
<a href="/steak-knife-sharpening-miami-restaurants/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Steak Knife Sharpening</div><div class="service-tile-body">Batch and recurring dining-room fleet care for restaurants, steakhouses, and hotels.</div></a>
<a href="/miami-knife-club/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Miami Knife Club</div><div class="service-tile-body">Recurring premium edge care for serious home cooks and private chefs.</div></a>
<a href="/send-photos/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Send Knife Photos</div><div class="service-tile-body">Share clear photos for repair, restoration, unusual knives, or condition review.</div></a>
<a href="/book/mail-in/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Mail-In Sharpening</div><div class="service-tile-body">Request approval, packing instructions, and a shipping plan before sending knives from outside the local service area.</div></a>
<a href="/book/" class="service-tile block"><div class="service-tile-title">Book Service</div><div class="service-tile-body">Choose restaurant, home-kitchen, or special-request service and start scheduling.</div></a>
</div>
<p class="sub-body mt-6">Questions about your edge? <a href="/knife-sharpening-guide/" class="text-cyan-300 underline underline-offset-4">Read the knife sharpening guide &rarr;</a></p>
</section>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
<div>
<p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-white/22 font-bold mb-4">&Agrave; la Carte</p>
<div class="space-y-0">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Working Edge Sharpening</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Fine edge: $9 minimum up to 6&quot;, then $1.50/in &middot; Serrated: $12 minimum, then $2/in</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">From $9</div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Repairs</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Minor repair $6 &middot; Major repair $10 &middot; Heavy, cleaver, axe, or specialty repair from $20+</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">Base + repair</div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Premium &amp; White Glove Care</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Performance finish upgrades, handle care, aesthetic refresh, polish, coating, and careful packaging when requested</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">From $30/knife</div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Pickup &amp; Return</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Priced separately from sharpening; route reductions may be offered on qualifying first service</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">$1/mile</div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Knife Exchange Program</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Trade dull knives for sharp refurbished ones &middot; Shipping included</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">$99</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-white/22 font-bold mb-4">Workshops</p>
<div class="space-y-0">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Knife Skills Intensive</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">4 weeks &middot; Weekly 2-hour sessions &middot; Sharpening instruction</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">$399</div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start py-3 border-b border-white/5">
<div><div class="text-white/72 text-sm font-semibold mb-0.5">Corporate Culinary Experience</div><div class="text-white/28 text-xs font-light">Half-day &middot; Up to 15 participants &middot; Sharpening demo + meal</div></div>
<div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold whitespace-nowrap ml-4">From $1,200</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-5 border-t border-white/5">
<a href="/book/" class="panel-cta-btn panel-cta-cyan">Book Service</a>
<a href="/send-photos/" class="panel-cta-btn panel-cta-ghost">Send Photos &rarr;</a>
</div>
</div>
</div><!-- /panel-services -->
